1. RECON (Understand the Target FIRST)
🎯 Goal: Know the system before attacking it
✅ Checklist:
 Create account(s) (user + second user if possible)
 Map all pages:
Login / Register
Profile
Password reset
Upload forms
Admin panels (if visible)
 Identify:
URL parameters (?id=123)
Forms (input fields)
API calls (check DevTools → Network)
🔥 Ask Yourself:
What can a normal user do?
Where is data being sent?
🧪 2. INPUT DISCOVERY (Where can I attack?)
🎯 Goal: Find ALL entry points
✅ Checklist:
 Text inputs
 Search bars
 File uploads
 URL parameters
 Headers (User-Agent, etc.)
 Cookies
 API JSON requests
🔥 Rule:

👉 If you can send data → you can break something

💥 3. XSS TESTING (High Success Rate)
🎯 Goal: Inject JavaScript
✅ Checklist:

Test EVERY input with:

<script>alert(1)</script>

Then try:

"><script>alert(1)</script>
Check:
 Reflected (response shows input)
 Stored (saved in profile/comments)
 DOM-based (JS handles input)
🔥 Pro Tip:
Look at:
Search pages
Profile fields
Comments/messages
🔓 4. IDOR TESTING (VERY IMPORTANT)
🎯 Goal: Access other users’ data
✅ Checklist:
 Find request like:
/api/user?id=123
 Change:
123 → 124 → 125
Test:
 Can you see another user’s data?
 Can you edit/delete it?
🔥 GOLDMINE Areas:
Profile pages
Orders/invoices
Messages
File downloads
🔑 5. AUTHENTICATION TESTING
🎯 Goal: Break login/security
✅ Checklist:
 Try weak passwords
 Test login responses:
Different errors?
 Password reset:
Can you reuse tokens?
Can you change email?
Test:
 Remove tokens in requests
 Replay old requests (Burp Repeater)
⚙️ 6. ACCESS CONTROL (BIG $$$ BUGS)
🎯 Goal: Do things you shouldn’t
✅ Checklist:
 Log in as User A
 Try:
Access admin pages
Modify privileged actions
Test:
 Change roles in requests:
"user":"admin"
📂 7. FILE UPLOAD TESTING
🎯 Goal: Upload dangerous files
✅ Checklist:
 Upload:
.php
.js
.html
.txt
 Try bypass:
file.php.jpg
file.phtml
Check:
 Can the file execute?
 Can others access it?
🌐 8. API TESTING (VERY POWERFUL)
🎯 Goal: Break backend logic
✅ Checklist:
 Open DevTools → Network
 Look for:
/api/
JSON requests
Test:
 Modify values:
"user_id":123 → 124
 Remove fields
 Add unexpected fields
🔁 9. REPLAY & MODIFY (BURP SUITE)
🎯 Goal: Manipulate requests
✅ Checklist:
 Send request to Repeater
 Modify:
Parameters
Headers
Tokens
🔥 This is where MOST bugs are found
📝 10. DOCUMENT EVERYTHING
🎯 Goal: Build your portfolio
✅ For EVERY test:

Write:

Feature:
What I tested:
Payload used:
Result:
Impact:
🔥 Even FAILED attempts matter
🚨 SIMPLE WORKFLOW (Memorize This)

Every session:

Recon
Find inputs
Pick ONE bug type
Test deeply
Modify requests
Document
💡 PRO TIPS (From Real Pentesters)
🎯 Depth > Breadth
🔁 Revisit same feature multiple times
🧠 Think: “What did the developer forget?”
🐢 Slow and logical beats fast and random
🎯 Your First Target Strategy

Start with:

Profile page
Password reset
Search bar

👉 These have the highest beginner success rate
